Ported rule ids: anthropic-api-key, aws-access-token, gcp-api-key,
github-app-token, github-fine-grained-pat, github-oauth, github-pat,
github-refresh-token, jwt, npm-access-token, openai-api-key,
slack-bot-token, slack-legacy-workspace-token, slack-user-token.

Local rules (authored in this crate, not gitleaks ports):
gcp-oauth-token (ya29 shape; gitleaks master carries no ya29 rule),
pem-private-key, authorization-basic, authorization-bearer,
url-credentials, x-access-token. OpenAI and Anthropic entries pair the
verbatim gitleaks regex with a relaxed companion shape for log
redaction; gcp-api-key, jwt, and npm entries drop the gitleaks
trailing-terminator guard so the terminator survives replacement.
